[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/comments/425647570","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/26174#issuecomment-425647570","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/26174","id":425647570,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQyNTY0NzU3MA==","user":{"login":"gkalpak","id":8604205,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MDQyMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8604205?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkalpak","html_url":"https://github.com/gkalpak","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkalpak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkalpak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkalpak/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkalpak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkalpak/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkalpak/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkalpak/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkalpak/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkalpak/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-09-29T14:04:16Z","updated_at":"2018-10-11T11:42:58Z","body":"Good point! This is an unwanted side effect of the fact that the [code-example][1] and [code-pane][2] elements as well as the [@example][3] dgeni tag-def expect the example's header to be defined via the `title` attribute (which has a special meaning in browsers).\r\n\r\n##\r\nThe proper solution would be to change the `title` attribute to something else (e.g. `header`), but that might affect many files through-out the code base (I haven't actually checked how many examples use titles).\r\n\r\nA less intrusive alternative would be to have the components remove the `title` attribute from the host element once they read the value (which should be fine because the title cannot change dynamically anyway).\r\n\r\n[1]: https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/2ad1bb4eb905b7d4982e6f82eb17da8d860a67e2/aio/src/app/custom-elements/code/code-example.component.ts#L43-L51\r\n[2]: https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/2ad1bb4eb905b7d4982e6f82eb17da8d860a67e2/aio/src/app/custom-elements/code/code-tabs.component.ts#L80\r\n[3]: https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/2ad1bb4eb905b7d4982e6f82eb17da8d860a67e2/aio/tools/transforms/examples-package/inline-tag-defs/example.js#L27","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/comments/425647570/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"gkalpak","id":8604205,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MDQyMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8604205?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkalpak","html_url":"https://github.com/gkalpak","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkalpak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkalpak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkalpak/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkalpak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkalpak/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkalpak/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkalpak/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkalpak/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkalpak/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":1874958776,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50MTg3NDk1ODc3Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/events/1874958776","actor":{"login":"example","id":57936,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3OTM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57936?v=4","gravatar_id":