updated (for bug fixes / features)\r\n\r\n\r\n## PR Type\r\nWhat kind of change does this PR introduce?\r\n\r\n<!-- Please check the one that applies to this PR using \"x\". -->\r\n```\r\n[x] Bugfix\r\n[ ] Feature\r\n[ ] Code style update (formatting, local variables)\r\n[ ] Refactoring (no functional changes, no api changes)\r\n[ ] Build related changes\r\n[ ] CI related changes\r\n[ ] Documentation content changes\r\n[ ] angular.io application / infrastructure changes\r\n[ ] Other... Please describe:\r\n```\r\n\r\n## What is the current behavior?\r\n<!-- Please describe the current behavior that you are modifying, or link to a relevant issue. -->\r\nThe `title` attribute of code-example and code-pane examples are in conflict with the HTML attribute `title`, which makes a tooltip appearing when we hover on those components.\r\n\r\nIssue Number: #26174 \r\n\r\n\r\n## What is the new behavior?\r\nAs suggested by @gkalpak, I renamed `title` into `header` and made the changes in the pages that used those components. \r\n\r\n\r\n## Does this PR introduce a breaking change?\r\n```\r\n[ ] Yes\r\n[x] No\r\n```\r\n\r\n<!-- If this PR contains a breaking change, please describe the impact and migration path for existing applications below. -->\r\n\r\n\r\n## Other information\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/26396/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/26396/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":1905054645,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDE5MDUwNTQ2NDU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/events/1905054645","actor":{"login":"wmarques","id":1577727,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1Nzc3Mjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1577727?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmarques","html_